{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b2f022d732d1983e97dacfc963b7290ff4f9eeda35897d989f796028c63c129b", "ja": "（『レインボーチョコ』というお菓子のCMに、\n春香とエレナが抜擢された。今は撮影の休憩時間だ）", "zh": "（春香和艾蕾娜被选中出演名为『彩虹巧克力』的点心广告。现在是拍摄休息时间）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "c005ccc93277191d32214c79ae6f9fd41287fa0164acdfe594cb841d64ca8022", "ja": "えへへ、もうひとつ食べようかなぁ。\nうーん、でも、ちょっと食べすぎな気も……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，要不要再吃一个呢。\n嗯——不过，好像也有点吃多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "d9802517dc4807fbf655ee8d339b4ef1389e352e54a2e487adf82ed8b17e6b58", "ja": "アハハ♪　ハルカ、このお菓子がすっかり\nお気に入りになったみたいだネ！", "zh": "啊哈哈♪ 春香好像已经彻底喜欢上这种点心了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c62c6824d48e03f86a88701258a644b493cd9074c1b2153d8661f6a86c8c0df1", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様。\nお、『レインボーチョコ』食べてるのか？", "zh": "两位都辛苦了。\n哦，你们在吃“彩虹巧克力”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "1d97d7922c14a9ffdfcdcf8807cd4c4fbbea95bf3feb14dbcbe7b63592d695cd", "ja": "あ、お疲れ様です！　スタッフさんが「休憩時間に\nどうぞ」って。これ、すっごく美味しいんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，辛苦了！工作人员说“休息时间请用”。这个真的特别好吃哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1005_p", "source_sha256": "726112db85e5bd3ed2197419a42810aaabb09bbfcc7bbe80e21334305f8683ee", "ja": "やっぱりそうか。撮影の様子を見ていて、\n美味しそうだなと思っていたんだ。", "zh": "果然是吗。我看着拍摄现场，\n就觉得看起来很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "a66bfbf1dbe5caea13012fe7b1961b54c5691f1e512e11172522b32ad09ee83b", "ja": "{$P$}も、食べてみたいノ？\nなら、ワタシのあげるよ！　はい、あーん。", "zh": "{$P$}也想尝尝看吗？\n那我把我的给你！来，啊——嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "09d33eb78db367ff899ced227e11c22148d8ca2eba2d15832b0a910821bfb8f0", "ja": "わわっ！？　エレナちゃん！\nす、ストップ、ストップ！", "zh": "哇哇！？艾蕾娜！\n等、等一下，停！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "38eb2f6cea48becb42e46e0c2134398fdd60c276ec4420fac2d2f918c3a2ba85", "ja": "……？　どうしたのハルカ？\n急に慌てちゃっ……あ、そっかー！", "zh": "……？怎么了春香？\n突然这么慌慌张张的……啊，原来是这样～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "ad19e3b0875af96ca5b4dac34610592fee3099e8daff585f5a91e2defe26c3d4", "ja": "エヘヘ……ワタシわかっちゃった♪\nもう、しょうがないナ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……我明白了♪\n真是拿你没办法呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a95a263b95a52f908c3fbb12e3be2cc2fa093deaf0367fd1f681f56aa661800", "ja": "ハルカ、もっとチョコ食べたいって言ってたもんネ！\nそれじゃ……あ～ん♪", "zh": "春香，你不是说还想多吃点巧克力嘛！\n那就……啊——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "be50313fb9f51e1c9c33a2436a924f6f269fed9182eaca999fe96b722f02813f", "ja": "あ、あれ？　そういうつもりじゃなかったん\nだけど……まあ、いっか♪　あーん！", "zh": "啊、咦？我不是那个意思来着……\n不过，算啦♪ 啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2f15c8a04d9215b2d0c110cdb98e45cb2ddef09cbb33a8172401ac9187f329c2", "ja": "はは、ふたりとも本当に仲がいいな。\n撮影中も、息がピッタリ合ってたもんな。", "zh": "哈哈，你们两个关系真好啊。\n拍摄的时候也配合得非常默契。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c7f980691387b3d4d5c73f7c25dad401e22dcca5ca9765532e05abbf102cce94", "ja": "本当ですか？\nえへへっ♪　相性バッチリだって、私たち！", "zh": "真的吗？\n诶嘿嘿♪ 我们俩的默契超棒的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "e8b674e0c26798c9c0456fd49f189739eeff5854ad9434de99233580dc407503", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて、うれしいナ～♪　だって\nハルカとお仕事すると、すっごく楽しいんだもん！", "zh": "听你这么说，我好开心呀～♪ 因为\n和春香一起工作，真的特别开心嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "97785811089d90bfa8a055a5deb1dc990f2145820f85236e123aa4f7442e4a30", "ja": "私も！　エレナちゃんといると、自然と笑顔に\nなれて……ずっと楽しい気持ちでいられるんだ♪", "zh": "我也是！和艾蕾娜在一起，就会自然而然地露出笑容……一直都能保持开心的心情呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a7aa656019906ed2e9478cba2ff639b4bd271faf016c1253f406b50bdded074b", "ja": "お互いにそう感じているなら、何も心配いらないな。\nこの後も、ふたりのコンビネーションに期待してるぞ！", "zh": "既然彼此都有这种感觉，那就什么都不用担心了。接下来也很期待你们两人的配合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b3cc14f26910f831b2772c4a6ba216d45099db1199b5e94435ab48d15768484", "ja": "まかせて、{$P$}！\nワタシ達で楽しいCMにしてくるヨー♪　そうだよネ？", "zh": "交给我吧，{$P$}！\n我们会拍出一支欢乐的广告回来哦～♪ 对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "3d145fd7c0202c4bf9d1f712b8d4f724b08d7a6daf41bb8a74c79c0f63dd1819", "ja": "うん！　一緒にがんばって『レインボーチョコ』の\n魅力をいっぱい届けようね、エレナちゃん♪", "zh": "嗯！我们一起加油，把“彩虹巧克力”的魅力充分传达给大家吧，艾蕾娜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0384_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0384_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f32d52a3d84319733c486087474d16134f11081acd460268b3c2ebba402ea4f6", "ja": "（その後も、ふたりは素晴らしい活躍を見せてくれた。\n完成したCMは、きっと視聴者に喜ばれることだろう）", "zh": "（之后，两人依然展现了精彩的表现。完成的广告一定能让观众感到开心吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
